bbb-plugin-remote-desktop (0.2.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Skip the force-reconnect on initial content entry to layout. The
    force-reconnect was firing on every fresh page load (not only on
    post-screenshare re-entry), producing two back-to-back websocket
    opens — one from the initial VncDisplay mount, one from the key
    change to 1. That double-connect raced websockify's check-and-spawn
    and, for moderator/teacher sessions, also raced two inetd
    teacher_desktop sessions on the same X display.

 -- Brent Baccala <cosine@freesoft.org>  Wed, 22 Apr 2026 23:30:00 +0000

